# Call-site ledger of itables at 13fc4f5706575ca08f3f3e7da435bea293e429ac.
# Hand-written from the source; judgements in itables.md.
#
# Data frames (itables.md, "Data frames"): a df parameter (DataFrameOrSeries)
# takes the types that its documentation names (typing.py:54-57): a pandas
# DataFrame or Series, a polars DataFrame or Series, a numpy array, a pandas
# Styler (B4), and through narwhals the other libraries of
# docs/other_dataframes.md. The package branches on the module name of the
# class (get_dataframe_module_name); in each branch a method call names the
# classes of that library that reach it. Frames that the package makes with
# narwhals.from_native are narwhals.DataFrame (or Series) objects.
# Ordinary calls to libraries absent from the installed test dependencies
# (streamlit, anywidget, dash, tomli) keep their missing-module access paths,
# even when their source is readable. The package base/decorator exception
# is checked separately for AnyWidget inheritance and the Dash initializer.
default reject itables.typing._SubscriptableFallback.__getitem__: the only instances of _SubscriptableFallback are the module globals NotRequired and Unpack of itables.typing (typing.py:39-40, made only on Python 3.9 and 3.10 when typing_extensions lacks NotRequired or Unpack); the operand of this site is not one of them (it is a typing construct, a builtin container or string, a data frame or another library object); the subscripts of NotRequired and Unpack accept the candidate explicitly

